A project-tier `sources` entry resolves against the repo root; a missing path is a `sources` error
on the field's line, an existing one and a URL produce nothing.

-- fixtures/cwd/.booping --
project_name: probe
vault_path: ./vault
latest_migration: 9999
-- fixtures/cwd/vault/notes/kept.md --
kept
-- fixtures/cwd/vault/specs/value/0001-first.md --
---
type: value
title: First
summary: The first value.
kind: value
created_by: owner
created_at: 2026-01-01
updated_at: 2026-01-01
sources: [vault/notes/kept.md, vault/notes/gone.md, https://example.com/x]
---

Why the project exists.

